 win the gold medal. Norway’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/109614"} "Magnus Moan"] ", 13th on the hill, was second only to Gottwald skiing, and chased him across the line, finishing only 5.4 seconds back to win the silver medal. The medalists in the sprint were the same as they had been in the individual event, but the order was changed. Ackermann and Spillane were never factors, finishing 8th and 10th, respectively."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Time Margin"] [:th {} "Ski Jumping, Large Hill"] [:th {} "Cross Country Skiing, 7.5 km"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/86160"} "Felix Gottwald"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/AUT"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/AUT.png"}] "AUT"]] [:td {} "—"] [:td {} "112.1 (12)"] [:td {} "17:35.0 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/109614"} "Magnus Moan"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/NOR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/NOR.png"}] "NOR"]] [:td {} "+5.4"] [:td {} "111.8 (13)"] [:td {} "17:38.4 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/101095"} "Georg Hettich"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GER"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GER.png"}] "GER"]] [:td {} "+9.6"] [:td {} "125.7 (1)"] [:td {} "18:38.6 (26)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/109612"} "Jason Lamy-Chappuis"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FRA"} [: